class_name PixelFont
## 3.0 Phase 4: the game's own bitmap font — an original 5x7 face (caps, digits,
## true lowercase with descenders, full printable ASCII plus the · and — the UI
## text uses), drawn from the tables below into a glyph atlas and built into a
## FontFile at boot. PixelFont.install() makes it every Control's default font,
## replacing Godot's anti-aliased UI font, which was the single most un-DOS
## thing on screen.
##
## Metrics: 6 px advance, cap height 7, descenders 2, designed at size 8. Integer-
## only scaling keeps every glyph pixel square: font_size 8 draws 1x, 16 draws 2x.

const SIZE := 8
const ADVANCE := 6
const ASCENT := 7
const DESCENT := 2
const ROWS := 9

